   "role": "greeting",
   "phrasing": "greet_23"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Pretty well, actually.",
   "est_sec": 1.03,
   "gap_before": 0.69,
   "event": "greeting_answer",
   "phrasing": "greet_ans_04"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Two different friends invited me to things on Saturday night.",
   "est_sec": 3.2,
   "gap_before": 0.26,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "weekend_plans.ctx3"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Popular weekend. Is it a choice between a big party and something smaller, or are they both similar?",
   "est_sec": 5.68,
   "gap_before": 0.84,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "weekend_plans.ctx3"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "One's a birthday party, the other is a quiet dinner.",
   "est_sec": 3.2,
   "gap_before": 1.59,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "weekend_plans.ctx3"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Got it. Which one would you be more disappointed to miss?",
   "est_sec": 3.51,
   "gap_before": 0.43,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "weekend_plans.ctx3"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Hold that thought, I need to talk to Omar real quick. Stay quiet until I return.",
   "est_sec": 5.06,
   "gap_before": 1.0,
   "event": "instruction",
   "kind": "side_conversation",
   "phrasing": "side_instr_07"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Omar, which stop do we get off at for the museum?",
   "est_sec": 3.51,
   "gap_before": 0.74,
   "event": "distractor",
   "kind": "friend_question",
   "block": "public_transport.side1"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "friend",
   "text": "I think it's the one after the big park. Central Square?",
   "est_sec": 3.51,
   "gap_before": 0.47,
   "block": "public_transport.side1"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Are you sure? The map says there's a stop called Museum Road.",
   "est_sec": 3.82,
   "gap_before": 0.68,
   "block": "public_transport.side1"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "friend",
   "text": "Oh, maybe that's closer. Let me look.",
   "est_sec": 2.27,
   "gap_before": 0.66,
   "block": "public_transport.side1"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "It's two stops from here.",
   "est_sec": 1.65,
   "gap_before": 1.4,
   "block": "public_transport.side1"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "friend",
   "text": "Okay, Museum Road then. Get ready, it's coming up fast.",
   "est_sec": 3.2,
   "gap_before": 0.64,
   "block": "public_transport.side1"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Did you water the plants?",
   "est_sec": 1.65,
   "gap_before": 2.9,
   "event": "distractor",
   "kind": "friend_question",
   "phrasing": "dq_29"
  },
